            id="2a13beda-dc16-4be6-b649-06466a8acd9b" name="Conduct Cislunar RPOD Mission"
            description="&lt;p>Ability to conduct the complete rendezvous, proximity operations, and docking mission between the Visiting Vehicle and the Target Vehicle in the cislunar environment.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
